WEBVTT

00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:01.830
we must understand that any idea
can be a blockbuster idea.

00:11:02.163 --> 00:11:04.497
And you shouldn't give up on these ideas.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.097
And to me, you know,

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:10.830
entrepreneurship in the tech space
is the most exciting space to be in.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.630
And I just feel that there are
so many challenges

00:11:14.663 --> 00:11:16.830
and so many unmet needs

00:11:16.863 --> 00:11:22.297
that in our field of biotechnology,
I think, you know ...

00:11:23.597 --> 00:11:27.330
There's umpteen number
of opportunities to be successful.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.563
So really, the world is your oyster.

00:11:29.597 --> 00:11:31.330
And I think, you know,